(6734856, 1008432, 128323, '<td valign="top">Awesome black and white! I love how the foreground draws you in, and the snow lines on the mountain take your eyes the rest of the way up to the clouds.  It''s so hard to do black and whites with minimal editing, but I think you''ve nailed it.</td>', 'Awesome black and white! I love how the foreground draws you in, and the snow lines on the mountain take your eyes the rest of the way up to the clouds.  It''s so hard to do black and whites with minimal editing, but I think you''ve nailed it.', '2012-04-07 07:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
